an8.17:1.6 | S: appearance, | T: by her appearance …
an8.17:1.7 | S: gifts of wildflowers, | T: by a present …
an8.17:1.8 | S: scents, | T: (none)
an8.17:1.9 | S: tastes, | T: (none)
